{
 "id": "modal-verbs",
 "title": "Les verbes modaux",
 "level": "A2",
 "topic": "Grammaire",
 "summary": "can, could, must, have to, should, may, might : capacité, obligation, conseil, probabilité.",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Règles communes"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "Pas de -s à la 3e personne : *she can* (jamais « cans »).",
    "Suivis du **verbe nu** : *I can swim*, pas « I can to swim ».",
    "Négation et question sans do : *can't*, *Can you…?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Les sens principaux"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "head": [
    "Modal",
    "Sens",
    "Exemple"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "can / can't",
     "capacité, permission",
     "I can speak English. Can I sit here?"
    ],
    [
     "could",
     "capacité passée, demande polie",
     "Could you help me?"
    ],
    [
     "must",
     "obligation forte / déduction",
     "You must wear a helmet. He must be tired."
    ],
    [
     "mustn't",
     "interdiction",
     "You mustn't smoke here."
    ],
    [
     "have to",
     "obligation extérieure",
     "I have to work tomorrow."
    ],
    [
     "don't have to",
     "pas obligé",
     "You don't have to come."
    ],
    [
     "should",
     "conseil",
     "You should sleep more."
    ],
    [
     "may / might",
     "possibilité",
     "It might rain. She may be late."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "tip",
   "text": "**Piège** : *must not* (interdit) ≠ *don't have to* (pas nécessaire). *You mustn't park here* ≠ *You don't have to park here.*"
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Demandes et permissions polies"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "*Could you…?*, *Would you…?*, *Would you mind…?* sont plus polis que *Can you…?*. Au bureau : *Could you send me the report?*"
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Déductions"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "*must be* (je suis presque sûr), *might / may be* (possible), *can't be* (impossible) : *She must be at work. He can't be serious.*"
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "You should back up your files.",
   "fr": "Tu devrais sauvegarder tes fichiers."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "I can't open this file.",
   "fr": "Je n'arrive pas à ouvrir ce fichier."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "Could I use your phone?",
   "fr": "Puis-je utiliser ton téléphone ?"
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "We have to finish by noon.",
   "fr": "Nous devons finir avant midi."
  }
 ],
